---
---
<section class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-20 border-b border-[var(--border)]" id="workflow">
<div class="max-w-2xl mb-10">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
<span class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--brand-primary)]">From checkout to delivery</span>
</div>
<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-3 tracking-tight">
          From shop to doorstep
        </h2>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)]">Four connected roles move an order from checkout to delivery.</p>
</div>

<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4">

<div class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] p-5 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-[var(--brand-primary)] bg-[var(--brand-tint)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[var(--border)]">STAGE 01</span>
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">Browse &amp; Order</h3>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">Browse products and shops, then choose the available checkout options.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--border)] font-sans text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
            Channel: aisley.app
          </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] p-5 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-[var(--brand-primary)] bg-[var(--brand-tint)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[var(--border)]">STAGE 02</span>
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">Seller Prepares</h3>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">Prepare the order, pack parcels, and print waybills.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--border)] font-sans text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
            Channel: seller.aisley.app
          </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--logistics-border)] p-5 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-[var(--logistics-primary)] bg-[var(--logistics-tint)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[var(--logistics-border)]">STAGE 03</span>
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">Logistics Coordinates</h3>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">Coordinate receiving, sorting, pickup, and dispatch.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--border)] font-sans text-sm text-[var(--logistics-primary)]">
            Channel: logistics.aisley.app
          </div>
</div>

<div class="bg-[var(--surface)] border border-[var(--border)] p-5 rounded-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
<div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
<span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-[var(--brand-primary)] bg-[var(--brand-tint)] px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-[var(--border)]">STAGE 04</span>
<svg class="stitch-icon" aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"><rect x="4" y="5" width="16" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="M8 5V3h8v2M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg>
</div>
<h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-[var(--ink)] mb-2">Courier Delivers</h3>
<p class="text-base text-[var(--muted)] leading-relaxed">Use the Rider mobile app for pickup and delivery workflows.</p>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-3 border-t border-[var(--border)] font-sans text-sm text-[var(--muted)]">
            Channel: Native Rider App
          </div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="section-action"><a class="primary-action" href="https://aisley.app" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Start shopping <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
</section>
